.norr-tech.com/def/law#lawNum> <https://jgkg.norr-tech.com/def/law#lawNumType> <https://jgkg.norr-tech.com/def/law#lawTitle> <https://jgkg.norr-tech.com/def/law#promulgationDate> <https://jgkg.norr-tech.com/def/law#repealStatus> <https://jgkg.norr-tech.com/def/law#revisionStatus> <https://jgkg.norr-tech.com/def/org#abolitionDate> <https://jgkg.norr-tech.com/def/org#cityName> <https://jgkg.norr-tech.com/def/org#houjinBangou> <https://jgkg.norr-tech.com/def/org#ministryCode> <https://jgkg.norr-tech.com/def/org#organizationKindCode> <https://jgkg.norr-tech.com/def/org#prefectureName> <https://jgkg.norr-tech.com/def/org#succeededBy> ) ;
